  "observations": {
    "home": "Connected home hierarchy, circular primary, dense cards, dark palette and mint emphasis match frozen Kf5tC/F5HENi. Native material darkness is permitted by Nop59, and controlled A/B visibly changes backdrop within primary/tab controls. Metadata is synthetic as declared.",
    "settings": "Visible hierarchy, grouping, text and dense surfaces match frozen Xdkgz. System symbols/typography and adaptive glass differ from canvas approximation without observed blocking clipping.",
    "servers": "Live target rk6dT has about 75pt rows; captured servers has about 80pt rows and exposes substantially less of eighth row. Header/title alignment and divider indentation also differ. Sorting action is present in capture but absent in this target; retention may be functional preservation, requiring reconciliation, not unilateral removal. Baseline diff review reconciles these inherited layout differences under R7; not candidate defects.",
    "profiles_and_sheets": "Live approved b4iufY WARP label is Разблокировать прокси с помощью WARP; capture uses Дополнительная безопасность с WARP. In GZ1YY Free toggle is near x190pt, capture near x146pt; Help is text-only in target but outlined with icon in capture. In w4rS3 sort action is near x231pt, capture near x313pt. Add-profile sheet top/height differ. These are visible text/control-position differences, not adaptive material differences. Underlying modal scene is different connection state and is not itself treated as a defect. Baseline diff review reconciles these as inherited source behavior and different WARP modes under R7; not candidate defects.",
    "motion_and_lifecycle": "Reviewed 257 Home samples with <=100ms spacing and all frames near start, 16s boundary and end; stable geometry, restrained aurora, no observed blank/corrupt image or boundary jump. Reviewed all 243 lifecycle frames: primary hidden during framework pause at 0.040-0.623s, restored at 0.633s; Settings visible 1.700s, Home restored 2.202s. Native tab selection settles correctly through short animation. No persistent missing control, wrong scene or corruption. All 1288 frames decoded with strictly increasing timestamps."
  },
